    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37899" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαισχ-ύνομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αισχυνθήσομαι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be ashamed at</i> or
				<i>of,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ οὐνόματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.143
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				4.1.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				247c
			</span></i>: c. inf., <i>to be ashamed</i> to do, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1373
			</span></i>: c. part., <i>to be ashamed of</i> doing or
			having done a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1307
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ph.</u>
				929
			</span></i>, etc.: abs., <i>feel shame, show a sense of shame,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				573b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				625
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> late in 
				Act.
			, <i>make ugly, mar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				20.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				42.421
			</span></i>.</div>
